{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2022-10-18 08:00:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT LAUNCHES THE PATH TO PRO NETWORK, UNIQUE JOBSEEKER PLATFORM FOCUSED ON THE SKILLED TRADES', 'text': 'PLATFORM HELPS JOBSEEKERS SHOWCASE THEIR TRADES EXPERIENCE AND CONNECT WITH HIRING TRADES PROFESSIONALS ATLANTA , OCT. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HOME DEPOT® LAUNCHED A NEW JOBSEEKER MARKETPLACE CREATED TO CONNECT SKILLED TRADESPEOPLE TO HIRING TRADES PROFESSIONALS IN THE CONSTRUCTION AND HOME IMPROVEMENT INDUSTRIES. ACCORDING TO A NEW SURVEY CONDUCTED BY THE HOME DEPOT IN PARTNERSHIP WITH MORNING CONSULT, HALF OF TRADES PROFESSIONALS (50%) SAY THAT DETERMINING WHETHER AN APPLICANT IS QUALIFIED FOR A JOB IS AN OBSTACLE TO HIRING.'}